WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.710
Nyra sat across the campfire. No one dared to come near her.

2
00:00:05.710 --> 00:00:10.750
Yesterday you kidnapped Aslı. Why should we trust you?

3
00:00:10.380 --> 00:00:13.420
Don't. I don't trust myself either.

4
00:00:13.470 --> 00:00:16.420
But I'm also the one who set Aslı free.

5
00:00:16.670 --> 00:00:19.790
She's telling the truth. She left that door open for us.

6
00:00:20.190 --> 00:00:24.670
Pusula slowly circled Nyra and scanned her.

7
00:00:24.970 --> 00:00:29.280
Her heart is a human heart. But there's a red code in her mind.

8
00:00:29.330 --> 00:00:31.130
The same code that was in Leon.

9
00:00:31.580 --> 00:00:34.300
So they tricked you the same way.

10
00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:36.710
When I woke up, Sila was beside me.

11
00:00:36.760 --> 00:00:40.550
She told me you were traitors who would destroy the world.

12
00:00:40.870 --> 00:00:46.070
Nyra's voice trembled. Her red eyes glistened in the firelight.

13
00:00:46.370 --> 00:00:51.410
But when I looked into Aslı's eyes, I didn't see a traitor. I saw a friend.

14
00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:55.700
My crystal pendant saved Leon. It can save you too.

15
00:00:56.070 --> 00:00:59.310
Not yet. If the code is erased, Sila will know at once.

16
00:00:59.360 --> 00:01:01.990
You need a spy on the inside.

17
00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:04.890
So you'll help us?

18
00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:09.050
I know the way to the fortress core. Here, take this map.

19
00:01:09.350 --> 00:01:12.190
Nyra held out a red crystal in her palm.

20
00:01:12.240 --> 00:01:16.230
Inside the crystal, every corridor of the fortress was glowing.

21
00:01:16.680 --> 00:01:19.880
Wow. Is there a video game version of this?

22
00:01:20.200 --> 00:01:23.720
Everyone laughed. Even Nyra. For the very first time.

23
00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:26.500
Before leaving, Nyra turned to Aslı.

24
00:01:26.800 --> 00:01:30.640
Thank Sergeant for me. He slept on my cape all night.

25
00:01:30.990 --> 00:01:35.950
Then she vanished into the dark. But in the fortress, Sila had heard everything.

26
00:01:36.400 --> 00:01:39.160
So my red warrior is betraying me.

27
00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:42.080
Good. I'll catch her in her own trap.

28
00:01:42.390 --> 00:01:45.650
Sila pulled the huge lever beside her throne.

29
00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:48.310
And all of Elyra shook to its core.

30
00:01:48.610 --> 00:01:53.650
Warning! The crystal network beneath the islands is collapsing. Elyra is breaking apart!

